# Test and cache
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Agent skill mirrors (.claude/skills, .cursor/skills, .grok/skills, .windsurf/skills and
# .gemini/commands) are NOT ignored. A symlinked mirror is 17 bytes and makes a fresh clone work
# immediately; a copy-fallback mirror is caught by `npm run guard:agents` if it ever diverges. That
# guard is the reason committing them is safe.
#
# The marker directory is what says an agent is in use. To stop supporting one, delete its whole
# directory — the guard stops looking for it, with no list to edit anywhere.
